The fused GEMM kernel (tm) follows the structure of Marlin
(https://github.com/IST-DASLab/marlin, Apache-2.0, Copyright Elias Frantar et al.):
stream-K work split, cp.async multi-stage pipeline, XOR-swizzled activation tiles,
ldmatrix + mma.sync, and fp32 partial-sum reduction through a global workspace.
The INT4 dequantization of Marlin is replaced by the lossless state-tree decode.
